WEBVTT

00:48:59.413 --> 00:49:02.663
technically solve the alignment
problem and

00:49:02.663 --> 00:49:07.413
the societal problem of deciding to which
set of human values do we align,

00:49:08.163 --> 00:49:11.038
then the systems understand
right and wrong,

00:49:11.038 --> 00:49:13.871
and they understand probably
better than we ever can,

00:49:14.121 --> 00:49:18.496
unintended consequences from complex
actions and very complex systems.

00:49:19.079 --> 00:49:22.204
And, you know, if we can train
a system which is like.

00:49:23.871 --> 00:49:29.121
Don't harm humanity and the system can
really understand what we mean when we

00:49:29.121 --> 00:49:33.038
say that, again, who is we and what does
that have some asterisks on them?